@node Top
@top waggle

@command{waggle} reads the Hive blockchain and acts on it: it builds, signs,
and broadcasts transactions using only Node built-ins, with no npm dependency
tree. Reads need no keys; writes need the relevant Hive private key from the
environment.
@end ifnottex

